      "name": "balanced_split",
      "description": "Six identical packets (S=10, Q=0.5), k=1. Optimal split is 3+3 (symmetric). Derivation: each half: (10+0.5\u00b710+0.25\u00b710)/0.125 = 17.5/0.125 = 140; total = 280.0.",
